# Claude Code session state and scratch notes -- not part of the submission.
.claude/
claude_log/

# Every Markdown file at the repository ROOT is an internal note except the
# README, which is the documentation the Data Availability statement points to.
# A pattern rather than a list, so a new scratch file cannot be committed by
# accident.  Subdirectory READMEs and the vendored achemso LICENSE are tracked.
/*.md
!/README.md

# Publisher PDFs fetched for the citation audit; not ours to redistribute.
References/

# The journals' author guides, kept locally for reference; also not ours to
# redistribute.
/ACS_author_guide.pdf
/PNAS_author_guide.pdf

# Working area for the 26 Oct 2026 stuck-pixel reprocessing: the stdout
# baselines the comparison was made against, the run logs, and a copy of the
# pre-reprocessing data_2021-3 (127 MB). Provenance only; safe to delete.
analysis/SAXPCS_8id/_scratch/

# Internal instructions for Claude Code; never part of the public repository.
# CLAUDE.md at any depth (the root one is also caught by /*.md above).
CLAUDE.md
/guidance/

# Personal login log appended by the shell; not part of the repository.
/.loglogin

# Local notes and message drafts; not part of the repository.
/memo/
